          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Shooting Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit that was targeted by all this unit&apos;s shooting attacks this phase to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. Add 1 to the roll if the target is a **^^Monster^^**. On a 3+, subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target&apos;s attacks for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
