          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Any Turn</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">This unit can only use this ability if any enemy models were slain this turn by this unit&apos;s combat attacks.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">**Heal (D6)** this unit. Then, remove it from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic>
