          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While a visible friendly **^^Vanari^^** unit is wholly within 12&quot; of this unit:
• You are treated as having 1 additional instance of **Varinor, Rune of Strength** depicted on your **battle scripture** for the purposes of the abilities on that unit&apos;s warscroll.
• If that unit is picked to be the target of the &apos;Depict Rune&apos; ability, you can apply the enhanced effects of that ability to that unit as if you had an instance of **Varinor, Rune of Strength** on your **battle scripture**.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
