            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible friendly **^^Lumineth Realm‑lords Infantry^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, attacks that target that friendly unit cannot score critical hits (treat them as regular hits instead).</characteristic>
