            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Firestealer Hammers** is 4.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Call of the Mountains" id="144b-b2e8-1747-bfb" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While a visible friendly **^^Alarith^^** unit is wholly within 12&quot; of this unit:
• You are treated as having 1 additional instance of **Alaithi, Rune of the Mountain** depicted on your **battle scripture** for the purposes of the abilities on that unit&apos;s warscroll.
• If that unit is picked to be the target of the &apos;Depict Rune&apos; ability, you can apply the enhanced effects of that ability to that unit as if you had an instance of **Alaithi, Rune of the Mountain** on your **battle scripture**.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Unbreakable Bulwark" id="9158-802e-d799-61b6" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit did not charge this turn, pick an enemy unit in combat with it to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, for the rest of the turn, while that enemy unit is in combat with this unit, all attacks made by models in that unit within this unit&apos;s combat range must target this unit.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="With the Force of a Landslide" id="8336-535a-b79f-460e" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute>
