            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 3 visible enemy units within 6&quot; of this unit this unit to be the targets.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll and subtract 1 from wound rolls for the target&apos;s attacks for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
