            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit used a **^^Shoot^^** ability this phase, this unit can move D6&quot;. Add 2 to the roll for each instance of **Oreali, Rune of the Wind** depicted on your **battle scripture**. It cannot end that move in combat.</characteristic>
