            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3 for each enemy unit within 6&quot; of this **^^Manifestation^^**. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll. If an enemy unit has at least 3 mortal damage inflicted on it by this ability this turn, it has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
