            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **Vanari Auralan Wardens** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the wall of blades. Then, pick an enemy unit in combat with the wall of blades to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice for each model in the wall of blades that is within 3&quot; of the target. For each 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic>
