                        <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If you depicted **Ydriliqi, Rune of the River** this battle round, pick a friendly **^^Ydrilan^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">The target can immediately use the &apos;Normal Move&apos; or &apos;Retreat&apos; ability as if it were your movement phase.</characteristic>
