                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit is **^^Alarith^^**, replace each rune on your **battle scripture** with **Alaithi, Rune of the Mountain**.
If this unit is **^^Hurakan^^**, replace each rune on your **battle scripture** with **Oreali, Rune of the Wind**.
If this unit is **^^Ydrilan^^**, replace each rune on your **battle scripture** with **Ydriliqi, Rune of the River**.
If this unit is **^^Scinari^^** or **^^Vanari^^**, pick 1 of the runes above and replace each rune on your **battle scripture** with that rune.</characteristic>
