                    <profile name="Realms Manifest" id="68d6-0f82-596c-e536" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
                      <attributes>
                        <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute>
                        <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute>
                        <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
                      </attributes>
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Deployment Phase</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following runes:
• **Ydriliqi, Rune of the River**
• **Alaithi, Rune of the Mountain**
• **Oreali, Rune of the Wind**
For the rest of the battle, while a visible friendly unit is wholly within 12&quot; of this unit:
• You are treated as having 1 additional instance of that rune depicted on your **battle scripture** for the purposes of the abilities on that unit&apos;s warscroll.
• If that unit is picked to be the target of the &apos;Depict Rune&apos; ability, you can apply the enhanced effects of that ability to that unit as if you had an instance of that rune on your **battle scripture**.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
                        <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                  <rules>
                    <rule name="Realms Manifest" id="1241-3864-c96e-2079" hidden="true">
                      <description>**^^Aelementor^^** only. Add the &apos;Realms Manifest&apos; ability to your hero&apos;s warscroll.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="Momentous Charge" id="0012-3938-39ef-3e90" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="4" type="upgrade">
