                        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Charge Phase</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick this unit and up to 2 other friendly **^^Lumineth Realm-lords^^** units wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the targets.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, when making charge rolls for the target(s), add 1 to the number of dice rolled, to a maximum or 3, then remove 1 dice of your choice and use the remaining dice as the charge roll.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
