                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">The first time this unit would be destroyed, before removing it from play, it is not destroyed and any remaining damage points inflicted on it have no effect. Then, **Heal (1)** this unit and for the rest of the battle:
• Ignore modifiers (positive and negative) to save rolls and ward rolls for this unit.
• This unit has **^^Ward (4+)^^** and **^^Fly^^**.
• This unit cannot be healed.</characteristic>
